# Frameworks for Technology and Communities of Alterity

**Authors:** Jessa Lingel

## Abstract
<p>This chapter provides the theoretical architecture for the remaining chapters. I start by outlining dominant narratives surrounding the internet as a way of setting up the countercultural narratives to follow. I describe the three-part framework anchoring this book: flexibility, legibility and authenticity.</p>

**Source:** https://doi.org/10.7551/mitpress/9780262036214.003.0002

